<section class="section"><div class="container article-body">
<h2>DQ Crispy Chicken Sandwich — What You Get</h2>
<p>The Crispy Chicken Sandwich is the standard DQ breaded chicken option. A whole white-meat chicken breast, breaded and fried to a crispy golden exterior, served with lettuce, tomato, and mayo on a toasted bun. At $7.99 and 470 calories, it is competitively priced against similar sandwiches at other major fast-food chains. Find all DQ sandwich options on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
<h2>Crispy Chicken Sandwich vs. FlameThrower Chicken — Is the Upgrade Worth It?</h2>
<p>The FlameThrower® Chicken Sandwich ($9.29) takes the crispy chicken base and adds FlameThrower sauce and additional toppings for a $1.30 premium. If you want more flavor complexity and can handle the heat, the FlameThrower is worth it. If you prefer a clean, classic crispy chicken sandwich, the standard at $7.99 is the right choice.</p>
