    <h2>DQ Crispy Chicken Sandwich — Built for Crunch</h2>
    <p>The DQ Crispy Chicken Sandwich uses a whole white-meat chicken breast fillet, breaded and fried for a consistently crunchy exterior with a juicy interior. At $7.99 and 470 calories, it is one of the better-value sandwiches on the burgers and sandwiches menu. For context and the full lineup, see <a href="/">The Dairy Queen Menu</a>.</p>

    <h2>Crispy vs. Grilled vs. FlameThrower Chicken Sandwich</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Sandwich</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Profile</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
