        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/grilled-chicken-sandwich">Grilled Chicken Sandwich</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$7.99</td><td>390</td><td>Lighter, flame-grilled, 80 fewer calories</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>FlameThrower® Chicken Sandwich</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$9.29</td><td>530</td><td>Crispy + FlameThrower sauce, spicy</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Spicy Chicken Strip Sandwich</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$8.49</td><td>510</td><td>Spiced chicken strip, not a fillet</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>

    <h2>What's on the Crispy Chicken Sandwich</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Crispy breaded chicken fillet</strong> — Whole white-meat breast, not a processed patty</li>
      <li><strong>Crisp lettuce</strong> — Fresh, adds coolness against the hot chicken</li>
      <li><strong>Tomato</strong> — Sliced, adds a juicy freshness</li>
      <li><strong>Mayo</strong> — Creamy, binds the sandwich flavors together</li>
      <li><strong>Toasted bun</strong> — Holds the fillet without getting soggy</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Best Pairing Options</h2>
    <p>The Crispy Chicken Sandwich is $7.99 alone. Pair it with:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/items/regular-fries">Regular Fries (Small)</a> — $2.49 → total $10.48</li>
      <li><a href="/items/cheese-curds">Cheese Curds</a> — $3.99 → total $11.98 (a more indulgent pairing)</li>
      <li><a href="/items/vanilla-soft-serve-cone">Vanilla Soft Serve Cone</a> — $2.39 for dessert → total $10.38</li>
