    </ul>

    <h2>Crispy Chicken Sandwich vs. Chicken Strip Basket</h2>
    <p>Both are $7.99–$9.99 range. The key difference: the <a href="/items/chicken-strip-basket-4pc">Chicken Strip Basket</a> ($9.99) comes with fries, Texas toast, and a dipping sauce already included. The Crispy Chicken Sandwich ($7.99) is the sandwich alone — sides cost extra. If you want a complete meal with sides included, the Chicken Strip Basket is the better all-in-one value.</p>

